{"id":"conv_05164","context":"An elderly couple talks softly about an ordinary day","ambient":"living_room_quiet","cast":["hiroshi_elder","sachiko_grandma"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"Today was just an ordinary day, wasn't it.","jp":"今日も平凡な一日だったね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[8,11,21,37,51,65,73,141,9530],"jpTokens":[{"s":"今日","r":"きょう","w":141},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"平凡","r":"へいぼん","w":9530},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"一","r":"いち","w":65},{"s":"日","r":"にち","w":37},{"s":"だっ","w":21},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"Yes, but being able to spend it quietly, I'm simply grateful.","jp":"ええ、でもこうして静かに過ごせること、ただただありがたいわ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,15,39,88,569,1133,2317,2478,3039,4108,6431,7562,9507,12469,12553,15290],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"でも","w":88},{"s":"こうして","w":2478},{"s":"静か","r":"しずか","w":2317},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"過ごせる","r":"すごせる","w":15290},{"s":"こと","w":15},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ただただ","w":9507},{"s":"ありがたい","w":4108},{"s":"わ","w":569},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"hiroshi_elder","mood":null,"en":"I get out of breath easily climbing the stairs now.","jp":"階段をのぼると息があがりやすくなったよ。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[5,6,8,9,43,47,68,718,1690,3332,3492,9151,9278,9484,12726],"jpTokens":[{"s":"階段","r":"かいだん","w":3492},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"のぼる","w":12726},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"息","r":"いき","w":3332},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あがり","w":9278},{"s":"やすく","w":718},{"s":"なっ","w":47},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"よ","w":68},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"sachiko_grandma","mood":null,"en":"My hands and feet get cold too, chilly days are hard.","jp":"私も手足が冷えて、寒い日はつらいの。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,3,4,6,11,37,38,3179,4969,7178,9176,9502,10195,13175],"jpTokens":[{"s":"私","r":"わたし","w":38},{"s":"も","w":11},{"s":"手足","r":"てあし","w":9502},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"冷え","r":"ひえ","w":9176},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"寒い","r":"さむい","w":3179